# Issue 3 — Declined bookings have no filter tab
## Feature: Assessor Bookings Page (sections 2.1 / 2.2)

## (3.1) Original pseudocode:
WHEN assessor clicks "All Bookings" tab
    Display allBookings

WHEN assessor clicks "Pending" tab
    ... filter where status is "Pending" ...

WHEN assessor clicks "Confirmed" tab
    ... filter where status is "Confirmed" ...

(2.2) WHEN assessor clicks "Decline" button on a booking
    Update booking in Firebase: set status = "Declined"

## (3.2) Trace table — before fix:
Test:	            |Assessor wants to review only declined bookings
Input:              |Click a "Declined" tab
Expected result:	|A filtered list showing only bookings with status = "Declined"
Actual result:      |No "Declined" tab exists — only All / Pending / Confirmed are defined, even though (2.2) can set a booking's status to "Declined"
			
## (3.3) Corrected pseudocode — added to match the existing tab pattern:
WHEN assessor clicks "Declined" tab
    Create empty list called declinedBookings
    FOR EACH booking IN allBookings
        IF booking's status is "Declined" THEN
            Add booking to declinedBookings
        END IF
    END FOR
    Display declinedBookings

## (3.4) Trace table — after fix (retest):
|Test	                                                    |Input	                |Expected result	                                            |Actual result
|allBookings has 5 items: 2 Pending, 1 Confirmed, 2 Declined|Click "Declined" tab	|declinedBookings list contains exactly the 2 Declined bookings	|Loop adds only the 2 
|                                                           |                       |                                                               |bookings with status = 
|                                                           |                       |                                                               |"Declined" — pass
